    {
      "id": "p0044-b002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "After receiving his university degree, Toby continues to compose music for Homes tuck and design games for fun. During this time, he uses another game creation tool known known as Game Maker to continue developing Undertale.",
        "raw": "After receiving his university degree, Toby continues to compose music for\nHomes tuck and design games for fun. During this time, he uses another game\ncreation tool known known as Game Maker to continue developing Undertale.",
