    {
      "id": "p0044-b003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Eventually, Toby releases a short, playable demo of Undertale to the public. The positive response encourages him to launch a crowdfunding campaign to fund further development. The campaign is a success, and allows Toby to spend the next two years developing the Undertale demo into a full-length game.",
        "raw": "Eventually, Toby releases a short, playable demo of Undertale to the public. The\npositive response encourages him to launch a crowdfunding campaign to fund\nfurther development. The campaign is a success, and allows Toby to spend the\nnext two years developing the Undertale demo into a full-length game.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.29064128,
          0.15434286,
          0.89401311,
          0.22064286
