    {
      "id": "p0044-b006",
      "kind": "quote",
      "source": {
        "text": "If you do any updates to the game, I might make it so NPCs can't walk through you. Also, a button to make the text scroll twice as fast (or instantly jump the ending position of the string) would be REALLY appreciated. After you've read the text once, scrolling through it all again gets kind of tiring.",
        "raw": "If you do any updates to the game, I might make it so NPCs can't walk\nthrough you. Also, a button to make the text scroll twice as fast (or\ninstantly jump the ending position of the string) would be REALLY\nappreciated. After you've read the text once, scrolling through it all again\ngets kind of tiring.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.32153387,
          0.29942143,
          0.85953848,
          0.36890714
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.32021843,
          0.29870714,
          0.86085392,
          0.36997857
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          13,
          15,
          16,
          18,
          20
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "如果你要更新游戏，我建议改成 NPC（非玩家角色）不能穿过玩家。另外，加一个按钮，让文字显示快一倍，或者一下子显示整句，我会非常感激。已经读过的文字，还得重新等它慢慢显示，实在有点烦。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
      },
