    {
      "id": "p0044-b007",
      "kind": "quote",
      "source": {
        "text": "Also ....... I'm working on a short (1h r) MOTHER-y RPG of my own right now. Depending on interest and my own sanity levels, I might try to assemble a team to create something amazing ... I wonder if Fangamer would be potentially interested in helping ...?",
        "raw": "Also ....... I'm working on a short (1h r) MOTHER-y RPG of my own right\nnow. Depending on interest and my own sanity levels, I might try to\nassemble a team to create something amazing ... I wonder if Fangamer\nwould be potentially interested in helping ...?",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
